### 7. Factual Sources & Standards Verified
* **Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS):** Mandatory hallmarking requirements under Indian law (BIS logo, 22K916 / 18K750 fineness grade, 6-digit alphanumeric HUID laser etching). Verification via the official BIS Care App.
* **Taxation & Fees:** 3% GST applicable on gold value and making charges; nominal statutory hallmarking assay fee with applicable GST.
* **Metallurgical Specifications:** 22K alloy ratio (91.67% pure Au + 8.33% Cu/Ag hardening metals); 18K alloy ratio (75% Au + 25% Cu/Ag/Zn/Ni).
* **Men's Sizing Anatomy:** Industry standard 18" (choker/base), 20" (collarbone), 22" (below collarbone/standard), 24" (mid-sternum/pendant), and 26"-30" (chest/ceremonial).

